ongoing reporting obligation may terminate
==========================================

5 ways this can be satisfied.

  1. (b)(1) — became an Exchange Act reporting company OF status
  2. (b)(2) — one annual report filed and fewer than 300 holders of record OF status
  3. (b)(3) — three annual reports filed and total assets not exceeding $10,000,000 OF status
  4. (b)(4) — all securities repurchased OF status
  5. (b)(5) — liquidated or dissolved OF status
